## Original Content
В Евросоюзе в июле цены на автомобильное топливо и масла для личного транспорта выросли на 16,9% к июлю 2025 года, по данным Eurostat.

## Summary
In July, prices for automotive fuel and oils for personal transport in the European Union increased by 16.9% compared to July 2025, according to Eurostat. This indicates a significant year-over-year rise in fuel costs across the EU.

## Key Points
- Fuel prices in the EU rose by 16.9% year-over-year in July.
- The increase applies to both automotive fuel and oils for personal transport.
- The data is sourced from Eurostat, the EU's statistical office.


